    "title": "Innovation Lab",
    "excerpt": "<p>The Innovation Lab de-risks decision making. Our team works with you in time-boxed, structured engagements. Outcomes include: The Lab enables departments to make better decisions anywhere in the project lifecycle: When you finish an engagement, your team can make data-informed decisions with confidence.&nbsp; There is no cost to work with the Lab. If you’re interested &#8230; <a title=\"Innovation Lab\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/work-with-us/innovation-lab/\" aria-label=\"More on Innovation Lab\">Read more</a></p>\n",
